       en="Changes in the food itself often use intransitive or passive perfective forms: *μαραίνομαι → να μαραθούν* (wilt), *σκάω → να σκάσουν* (burst), *καίγομαι → να καεί* (burn), *ψήνομαι → να ψηθεί* (be cooked). Recognising them is key to reading the readiness clues of a recipe.",
